"Hith-er, page, and stand by me,
F4 F4 F4 G4 F4 F4 C4(2)
If thou know'st it, tell-ing,
D4 C4 D4 E4 F4(2) F4(2)
Yon-der peas-ant, who is he?
F4 F4 F4 G4 F4 F4 C4(2)
